
#Data tables for asymmetric interior loops of size 3
#Free energies at 37 degrees for RNA fully substituted with pseudoU in place of U
 
#Data Arrangement:
#For the 4x4 tables, each starting pair needs its own table.
#Example:  
#		5' --> 3'
#		    X
#		   C  C
#		   G  G
#		    YA
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y ->
# 	----------------------------
#	(X)	A	C	G	P
# 	 |--------------------------
#     V
#	(A)	2.5	2.3	1.1	2.3
#	(C)	2.3	2.3	2.3	2.0
#	(G)	1.7	2.3	0.8	2.3
#	(P)	2.3	2.0	2.3	-0.9


#An energy of "." is "infinity," i.e. not allowed.


#		5' --> 3'
		    X
		   C  C
		   G  G
		    YA
#		3' <-- 5'
#		    Y 
# 	----------------------------
	A	C	G	P
# 	----------------------------
